### Payment Ledger — API test file
### Click the green ▶ in the gutter next to any request to run it.
### Edit the values (owner, id, amount) and re-run — this is your one reusable test file.

@host = http://localhost:8086
@accountId = 1

### 1. Create an account  (change owner/currency and re-run to make more)
POST {{host}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "Asha",
  "currency": "INR"
}

### 2. Get an account by id
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}

### 3. Get an account's balance (derived by summing ledger entries)
GET {{host}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/balance

### 4. Missing account -> should return 404
GET {{host}}/accounts/999

